      "en_US": [
        "Lyra: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You can catch wild Pokémon\f",
        "with Poké Balls.\r",
        "Follow me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0373_R29_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Ethan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You can catch wild Pokémon\f",
        "with Poké Balls.\r",
        "Follow me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0373_R29_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "...Just like that!\r",
        "...\n",
        "Huh? Was I too fast?\r",
        "I’ll try again. Come this way!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0373_R29_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "See? Just like that!\r",
        "It’s better to lower your\n",
        "target’s HP more than I did,\f",
        "or make it sleep or something.\r",
        "You can try all kinds of things\n",
        "to see what works.\r",
        "I’ll give you these. Good luck!\r"
      ]
    },
