    {
      "id": "msg_0373_R29_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, how are your Pokémon?\r",
        "If they’re weak and not ready for\n",
        "battle, keep out of the tall grass."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0373_R29_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you see those ledges?\n",
        "It’s scary to jump off them.\r",
        "But you can go to New Bark Town\n",
        "without walking through tall grass."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0373_R29_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "I wanted to take a break, so I\n",
        "saved to record my progress."
